Z||000005||pherder||05-16-2001||10:44 AM||||Here is a URl for the only 348 kit I have found ... so far.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.spoilers.com/images/autos1/MR2166f.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.spoilers.com/images/autos1/MR2166r.jpg"> <P> <A HREF="http://www.spoilers.com/ge/toymr290.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.spoilers.com/ge/toymr290.htm</A> <P>Scroll down to TOYOTA MR2 Style 166<P>Yes, it is for a toyota MR2 but may be able to fit a Fiero (with a lot of work!)<P>Paul<BR>||||reg||1
